  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: on Magnisi peninsula</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient settlement located on Sicily's Magnisi peninsula (in the modern administrative municipality of Priolo Gargallo, Siracusa province). The site was inhabited from the Bronze Age through at least the Greek archaic period, with subsequent, periodic military use and construction from the Classical through the modern period.",
